{"id":"f1d6e4d39157ce8d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Indiscernible Sequence","display":"df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence — ZFC Indiscernible Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence — ZFC Indiscernible Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-indiscernible]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence — ZFC Indiscernible Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"58-df-indiscernible\">58-df-indiscernible</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (ordinal-indexed sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\">\\(M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\\)</span> (structure, language, ordinal length, and satisfaction data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\)</span> (typed indiscernible-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"58-df-indiscernible\">58-df-indiscernible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The alias preserves every semantic parameter required upstream: language, ordinal length, satisfaction recursion, and base assignment.  A two-place call would not determine the truth relation used to test indiscernibility.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-indiscernible","status":"resolved","id":"2106ba11326cfe10","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-indiscernible]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-indiscernible","status":"resolved","id":"2106ba11326cfe10","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)$ (typed indiscernible-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-indiscernible]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{IndiscernibleSequence}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Indisc}_S(I,M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)","display":true}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-indiscernible-sequence]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2106ba11326cfe10"]}